; An RPZ written with $ORIGIN and absolute names, as BIND or Technitium export one
$ORIGIN rpz.example.org.
$TTL 1h
@                         SOA ns.example.org. hostmaster.example.org. 7 3600 600 86400 60
@                         NS  ns.example.org.
ads.example.com           CNAME .
ads.example.com.rpz.example.org. CNAME *.
*.track.example.net.rpz.example.org. CNAME .
$ORIGIN example.com.rpz.example.org.
beacon                    CNAME .
*.pixel                   CNAME rpz-drop.
; outside the zone: skipped
stray.example.net.        CNAME .
; an NS below the apex is no zone record: local data
sub.example.com.rpz.example.org. NS ns.example.org.
